  <steps mode="prescriptive">
    <step order="0" name="Gate + context + rigor declaration">Output the FULL rigor-level declaration. CONFIRM task 006 (Phase 0 gate) is GREEN — this deletion is gated and MUST NOT proceed otherwise. CONFIRM tasks 030 + 031 are complete and the EDGE-1…4 wisdom is present in `ComposeShadowPatchEngine` (grep the engine for the migrated behaviors). Load knowledge files + `bff-extensions.md`; state the Placement Justification + the R3 Path-B supersession note for the PR.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Route writing through the engine + invert the contract">Update `ComposeEndpoints.cs` so all save/annotation writing calls `ComposeShadowPatchEngine` and accepts the operation-log contract (task 003), replacing the `DocxAnnotation` + `ComposeEditedParagraph` payloads. A save submitting a stale/legacy payload shape returns a ProblemDetails (validation), not a 500.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Coverage check BEFORE deletion">Enumerate every behavior the old writers had (redline synthesis, comment/annotation placement, EDGE-1…4 ordering); confirm each is covered by the Patch Engine. If ANY legacy-only behavior is not covered, STOP and escalate (Path-B) — do not delete.</step>
    <step order="3" name="Delete the legacy writers">Delete `DocxAnnotationWriter.cs` (whole class incl. `LocateTarget` + `DocxAnnotation.TargetText`) and `ComposeParagraphRedlineSynthesizer.cs`. Remove their DI registrations and any residual server-side wiring. Grep to confirm zero remaining call sites of both classes + `DocxAnnotation.TargetText`.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Update seam + build">Update the `tests/integration/seam/Compose/` save/load slice to the operation-log contract (aligns with task 034). Build the BFF; run the Tier-1 NetArchTest facade check; run the Compose suite (no regression on retained behavior).</step>
    <step order="5" name="Size/CVE + index + deviations">Publish; report absolute size + delta vs ~49.63 MB (≤60 MB — expect a reduction from the deletions); `dotnet list package --vulnerable --include-transitive`. Run `/conflict-check`. Update TASK-INDEX.md: set this task's status to ✅. Document any deviation (and the Path-B supersession) in `projects/spaarkeai-compose-r4/notes/`.</step>
  </steps>

